  "body": "<p class=\"wysiwyg-text-align-center\"><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-130700ae-7fff-32dd-bd55-0312ed91c987\"><img src=\"https://support.discord.com/hc/article_attachments/24012861138455\" width=\"677\" height=\"212\"></span><strong><br></strong></p>\n<p id=\"docs-internal-guid-0184e532-7fff-30da-6abf-fe4d0a58d92e\"><span class=\"wysiwyg-font-size-large\"><strong>What this article covers:</strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://support.discord.com/hc/en-us/articles/360036118732#h_01HXSMJ4E33V9MTMRYKAV0DZRJ\">What are Discord Official Messages?</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://support.discord.com/hc/en-us/articles/360036118732#h_01HXSMJZ9ZA1YT2QFS7YZ0PE0K\">How to Verify the Message is From Discord</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://support.discord.com/hc/en-us/articles/360036118732#h_01HZQSFDH2VSQXV1QKZ633W22P\">Urgent Messages</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h1 id=\"h_01HXSMJ4E33V9MTMRYKAV0DZRJ\" class=\"wysiwyg-text-align-left\">What are Discord Official Messages?</h1>\n<p><strong>Discord <span id=\"docs-internal-guid-327a5dbc-7fff-91ed-63da-93666af0b580\">Official</span> Messages</strong> are messages that we send to alert you of an account issue.</p>\n<p>These <strong>messages</strong> can range from a variety of Payment issues, Support Ticket Updates, and ToS Violation Warnings.</p>\n<h3 id=\"h_01HXSMJ4E4A9136P4BFD5G00DT\" class=\"wysiwyg-text-align-left\"> <strong>Note</strong>: Discord will never ask you for your password or account token.</h3>\n<h2 id=\"h_01HXSMJZ9ZA1YT2QFS7YZ0PE0K\">How to Verify the Message is From Discord? </h2>\n<p>There are few ways to confirm that the message you're receiving is really from Discord:</p>\n<p>1. Messages from Discord will always have the <strong>OFFICIAL</strong> badge in the member list.</p>\n<p class=\"wysiwyg-text-align-center\"><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-ddb1d728-7fff-0a60-a30e-76efdfb014ed\"><img src=\"https://support.discord.com/hc/article_attachments/24012861143703\" width=\"298\" height=\"561\">   <span id=\"docs-internal-guid-1a3bf585-7fff-1a30-2722-49006fd22baa\"><img src=\"https://support.discord.com/hc/article_attachments/24012861149079\" width=\"259\" height=\"561\"></span><br></span></p>\n<h4 id=\"docs-internal-guid-d4204331-7fff-6461-4acc-4d70cdd3edf2\" class=\"wysiwyg-text-align-center\"><span style=\"color: #666666;\">Desktop View (Left) and Mobile View (Right)</span></h4>\n<p class=\"wysiwyg-text-align-left\">2. The start of your direct message (DM) with Discord will have special text informing you that this is an official message.</p>\n<p class=\"wysiwyg-text-align-center\"><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-17597a0c-7fff-1f66-bcae-8c2efbdb9eca\"><img src=\"https://support.discord.com/hc/article_attachments/24012861154199\" width=\"624\" height=\"209\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"wysiwyg-text-align-left\">3. The message from Discord will also have the <strong>OFFICIAL</strong> badge inside the DM.</p>\n<p class=\"wysiwyg-text-align-center\"><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-e009c6cd-7fff-a8ce-f7f6-b762b9d818f7\"><img src=\"https://support.discord.com/hc/article_attachments/24012861159959\" width=\"624\" height=\"104\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"wysiwyg-text-align-left\">4. You cannot reply to <strong>Official Messages</strong> from Discord, and will see a banner across the bottom of the message blocking chat input.</p>\n<h3 id=\"docs-internal-guid-943c29b8-7fff-6cac-af7e-def933d1d7d0\">\n<span style=\"color: #434343;\">You can learn more about the Official Messages from Discord by taking a look at the Discord Updates </span><strong><span style=\"color: #434343;\">profile</span></strong><span style=\"color: #434343;\">. On desktop, right-click Discord Updates within the </span><strong><span style=\"color: #434343;\">DM list</span></strong><span style=\"color: #434343;\"> or </span><strong><span style=\"color: #434343;\">DM &gt;</span></strong> <strong><span style=\"color: #434343;\">Profile</span></strong><span style=\"color: #434343;\">. If you are on mobile, long-press Discord Updates &gt; </span><strong><span style=\"color: #434343;\">Profile</span></strong><span style=\"color: #434343;\">. </span>\n</h3>\n<h1 id=\"h_01HZQSFDH2VSQXV1QKZ633W22P\" class=\"wysiwyg-text-align-left\"><span class=\"wysiwyg-font-size-x-large\"><strong>Urgent Messages</strong></span></h1>\n<p>Urgent messages will also come with an in-app popup to alert you that you have a new message to read. </p>\n<p class=\"wysiwyg-text-align-center\"><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-a483c836-7fff-e04f-eeb3-6e3df8185051\"><img src=\"https://support.discord.com/hc/article_attachments/24012872184471\" width=\"498\" height=\"354\"></span></p>\n<h3 id=\"01HXSMPXP8PDF28VMBBKD23W7A\" class=\"wysiwyg-text-align-center\"> Note: Discord will never ask you for your password or account token.</h3>",
